    {
      "text": "改写宇宙规则，把掉落、任务与难度都变成可编辑系统",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Reality Break is a fast-paced ARPG with many interlocking systems and an opt-in roguelite structure, all of which is modifiable via a new Rewrite mechanic that allows you to alter the fundamental nature of the gameplay for unparalleled build customization.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1473060/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "重置时间线，积累现实点数解锁跨周目成长",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Each time you reset, you will gain Reality Points which can be allocated to talents that majorly alter reality itself, applying those changes to both current and future pilots via a metagame talent system.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1473060/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "穿梭多条时间线，改写旧事件并揭开现实力量的真相",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "With each timeline, you unlock new shocking secrets, change the outcome of previous scenarios and reveal new ways of looking at the universe.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1473060/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
